{"id":"416c88247167f266","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-direct-sum.md","title":"Direct Sum","display":"df-direct-sum — Direct Sum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-direct-sum","aliases":["58-df-direct-sum"],"display":"df-direct-sum — Direct Sum","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-direct-sum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-direct-sum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-direct-sum — Direct Sum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,I\\in V\">\\(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,I\\in V\\)</span> (field structure and index set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\\in V^I\">\\(\\mathcal V\\in V^I\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V(i)=\\langle V_i,+_i,\\odot_i,0_i\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal V(i)=\\langle V_i,+_i,\\odot_i,0_i\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> (fully explicit vector-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirectSum}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{DirectSum}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> (direct-sum predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}direct\\text{-}sum}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{DirectSum}_S(W,\\mathcal V,I,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathcal V\\in V^I\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal V(i)=\\langle V_i,+_i,\\odot_i,0_i\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V_i,k,+_i,\\odot_i,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land0_i\\in V_i\\land\\forall v\\in V_i\\;\\bigl(+_i(\\langle0_i,v\\rangle)=v=+_i(\\langle v,0_i\\rangle)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land W=\\left\\{x\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}V_i:\\left|\\{i\\in I:x(i)\\neq0_i\\}\\right|&lt;\\omega\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}direct\\text{-}sum}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{DirectSum}_S(W,\\mathcal V,I,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathcal V\\in V^I\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal V(i)=\\langle V_i,+_i,\\odot_i,0_i\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V_i,k,+_i,\\odot_i,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\land0_i\\in V_i\\land\\forall v\\in V_i\\;\\bigl(+_i(\\langle0_i,v\\rangle)=v=+_i(\\langle v,0_i\\rangle)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land W=\\left\\{x\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}V_i:\\left|\\{i\\in I:x(i)\\neq0_i\\}\\right|&lt;\\omega\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The direct sum is the finite-support subspace of the direct product. Every summand's addition, scalar action, and zero vector are carried by the indexed structure datum <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\subseteq V^8$ (fully explicit vector-space predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V\\in V^I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V(i)=\\langle V_i,+_i,\\odot_i,0_i\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirectSum}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}direct\\text{-}sum}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{DirectSum}_S(W,\\mathcal V,I,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathcal V\\in V^I\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal V(i)=\\langle V_i,+_i,\\odot_i,0_i\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V_i,k,+_i,\\odot_i,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\\n&\\hspace{34mm}\\land0_i\\in V_i\\land\\forall v\\in V_i\\;\\bigl(+_i(\\langle0_i,v\\rangle)=v=+_i(\\langle v,0_i\\rangle)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land W=\\left\\{x\\in\\prod_{i\\in I}V_i:\\left|\\{i\\in I:x(i)\\neq0_i\\}\\right|<\\omega\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false}],"bytes":1356,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-432","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-direct-sum.md|58-df-direct-sum]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["592f9cfb66a507c2"]}